        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-09T17:13:21.547Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You should try narrating a few games for us on the board sometime!  Or, if you’re not a typist, maybe record YouTube videos?  I haven’t enjoyed the Handelabra streams on the few occasions I turned into them, but they don’t really try to make them into improv theater; perhaps your storytelling might fare better.</p>",
